flowchart TD
  A[User selects new organization/event] --> B[Enter blocking transition]
  B --> C[Cancel old requests]
  C --> D[Pause sync]
  D --> E[Dispose context providers]
  E --> F[Close old streams and purge scoped cache]
  F --> G[Commit new context version]
  G --> H[Reload permissions and minimum data]
  H --> I[Resume sync]
  I --> J[Render new context only]
